sequenceDiagram
    participant Sink
    participant Src as Source(monitor)
    participant Cable as cable
    Sink->>Src: EPR_Mode_Enter
    Src->>Sink: Enter Acknowledged
    Src->>Cable: Discover Identity (SOP')
    Cable->>Src: 50V/5A 宣告
    Src->>Sink: Enter Succeeded
    Src->>Sink: EPR_Source_Capabilities
    Sink->>Src: EPR_Request
    Src->>Sink: Accept
    Src->>Sink: PS_RDY
    loop 週期
        Sink->>Src: EPR_KeepAlive
        Src->>Sink: KeepAlive_ACK
    end
